title: Trzaskowski's Crisis Table
subtitle: A hostile PiS cabinet can be convened, not commanded, by the President.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_negotiation_card
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_palace_mediation_timer <= 0 and president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and government_party = "pis" and national_crisis_pressure >= 25
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_palace_mediation_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/dossier.svg

= The President can convene; the Sejm must still deliver

President Trzaskowski offers a public table between the PiS cabinet, Lewica,
KO, local government and the relevant services. His office contributes **14
points** to the leverage already shown; that bonus is included in the current
**[+ negotiation_leverage +]**.

PiS hostility remains **[+ government_negotiation_hostility +]**. Crisis
pressure is **[+ national_crisis_pressure +]**. The table can produce a narrow
statute, expose refusal, or intensify the rally-around-the-flag effect.

- @table
- @bill
- @veto_front

@table
title: Ask the Palace to broker one signed emergency protocol
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources · score +14 · success at 58. No hidden roll.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A tripartite secretariat and implementation record require two resources.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.negotiation_attempts += 1;
Q.negotiation_last_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.negotiation_leverage) || 0) + 14
);
Q.negotiation_last_threshold = 58;
Q.negotiation_success =
    Q.negotiation_last_score >= Q.negotiation_last_threshold ? 1 : 0;
Q.negotiation_last_result = Q.negotiation_success
    ? "Presidential crisis protocol signed"
    : "PiS walks out of the presidential table";
if (Q.negotiation_success) {
    Q.negotiation_successes += 1;
    Q.negotiation_capital += 5;
    Q.president_relation += 5;
    Q.pis_relation += 3;
    Q.ko_relation += 2;
    Q.household_security += 5;
    Q.health_capacity += 3;
    Q.local_network += 2;
    Q.pis_cohabitation_stress += 5;
    Q.trz_right_fragmentation += 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 2;
    Q.public_trust += 4;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Trzaskowski brokers a crisis protocol that PiS ministers must implement";
} else {
    Q.negotiation_capital -= 2;
    Q.president_relation += 2;
    Q.pis_relation -= 4;
    Q.pis_cohabitation_rally += 7;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 5;
    Q.pis_poll_momentum += 0.3;
    Q.public_trust -= 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "PiS leaves the Palace table and rallies against an opposition presidency";
}
!}
go-to: result

@bill
title: Let Trzaskowski introduce the narrow bill and dare PiS to amend it
subtitle: Automatic agenda gain · +5 repair/delivery mandate · also +5 PiS backlash.
on-arrival: negotiation_success = 0; negotiation_last_result = "Presidential bill enters the Sejm without a government pact"; negotiation_last_score = negotiation_leverage; negotiation_last_threshold = 58; president_relation += 4; media_capacity += 3; public_trust += 2; trz_right_backlash += 5; pis_cohabitation_stress += 3; pis_cohabitation_rally += 3; government_coalition_dissent += 1; judicial_repair_mandate += 2; news_headline = "A presidential bill forces PiS factions to choose amendments or rejection"
go-to: result

@veto_front
title: Abandon mediation and prepare a common opposition veto campaign
subtitle: +4 Palace relation · +5 PiS rally · no crisis delivery.
on-arrival: negotiation_success = 0; negotiation_last_result = "No mediation — opposition veto front"; negotiation_last_score = negotiation_leverage; negotiation_last_threshold = 58; president_relation += 4; ko_relation += 3; pis_relation -= 5; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 5; trz_right_backlash += 4; pis_cohabitation_rally += 5; government_delivery -= 2; news_headline = "The Palace and opposition prepare the next veto instead of a compact"
go-to: result

@result
title: Cohabitation chooses a direction
new-page: true

**[+ negotiation_last_result +]**  
Score **[+ negotiation_last_score +]** · required **[+
negotiation_last_threshold +]** for a signed protocol.

[? if negotiation_success: The President matters because he supplied a venue,
drafting authority and public enforcement. PiS remains the government and
Lewica remains opposition.?]
[? if not negotiation_success: Failure is politically productive for someone:
PiS can rally against a rival centre of power, while its factions can also
blame one another for rejecting material relief.?]

- #poland_card_finish
